OL,3,GNEWSAA1 southbound reopens after lorry
OL,4,Acrash near Newark
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1 in Nottinghamshire has
OL,7,Freopened after a lorry crashed into the
OL,8,Fcentral reservation.
OL,10,FOfficers from Nottinghamshire Police
OL,11,Fwere called to the southbound
OL,12,Fcarriageway between the A6075 at
OL,13,FTuxford and the A46 near Newark about
OL,14,F09:30 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FNational Highways has said the stretch
OL,17,Fhas now reopened to traffic after being
OL,18,Fclosed for more than two hours.
OL,20,FMotorists are being warned of initial
OL,21,Fdelays of 30 minutes and three miles of
OL,22,Fcongestion on approach.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
